since poly() returns a matrix, you have to give it a uniqe name

> A=poly(1:10,2)
> colnames(A) = c("A1", "A2")

> B=poly(1:10,2)
> colnames(B) = c("B1", "B2")

and then you can use it as

	y ~ .... + A + B +

